acOS 15, Windows 11, Ubuntu 24.04).","f":[]},{"s":34655,"e":34738,"k":"block","t":"Exact steps to reproduce the problem, what you expected, and what happened instead.","f":[]},{"s":34748,"e":34949,"k":"block","t":"A relevant excerpt from the application log KTPH000 (see KTPH001Configuration filesKTPH002) and, for crashes, any crash report your OS produced.","f":["<code>~/.kortty/kortty.log</code>","<a href=\"../reference/config-files.html\">","</a>"]},{"s":34959,"e":34997,"k":"block","t":"A screenshot if the problem is visual.","f":[]},{"s":35019,"e":35326,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Open the issueKTPH001 at KTPH002https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/newKTPH003: use a short, specific title (e.g. KTPH004\"SFTP tab freezes when renaming a file on Windows 11\"KTPH005), paste the collected facts into the description, and submit it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/new\">","</a>","<em>","</em>"]},{"s":35336,"e":35450,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Stay reachableKTPH001 — follow-up questions on the issue are common; enable GitHub notifications for it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":35523,"e":35536,"k":"block","t":"Data Security","f":[]},{"s":35544,"e":35730,"k":"block","t":"Log files and screenshots can contain sensitive information such as hostnames, usernames, file paths or session details. Review and redact everything you attach to a public GitHub issue.","f":[]},{"s":35777,"e":35891,"k":"block","t":"Suggest a feature or ideaKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#suggest-a-feature-or-idea\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":35906,"e":36114,"k":"block","t":"Check KTPH000https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issuesKTPH001 for similar suggestions first — add a comment or a 👍 reaction there instead of opening a duplicate.","f":["<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues\">","</a>"]},{"s":36124,"e":36373,"k":"block","t":"Open a new issue at KTPH001https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/newKTPH002 with a title starting with KTPH000 (e.g. KTPH003\"Feature: bookmark folders in the connection manager\"KTPH004).","f":["<code>Feature:</code>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/new\">","</a>","<em>","</em>"]},{"s":36383,"e":36598,"k":"block","t":"Describe the KTPH000use caseKTPH001 — what you are trying to accomplish and why the current behavior falls short — rather than only the solution you have in mind. Mockups or examples from other tools are welcome.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":36613,"e":36711,"k":"block","t":"Release notes for shipped changes are collected in KTPH000Release notesKTPH001.","f":["<a href=\"release-notes.html\">","</a>"]},{"s":37589,"e":37604,"k":"text","t":"\n  Back to top\n","f":[]},{"s":37847,"e":37888,"k":"text","t":"MIT-licensed · Developed by Daniel Mengel","f":[]},{"s":37934,"e":37946,"k":"text","t":"\n    korTTY ","f":[]},{"s":37954,"e":37961,"k":"text","t":"v2.10.0","f":[]}]}